menu "CoffeeProbe bring-up"

    config PROBE_BRINGUP_DIAG
        bool "Run bring-up diagnostics instead of the app"
        default n
        help
            When enabled, app_main runs hardware diagnostics and never starts the
            normal app: an I2C bus scan (an OLED is usually 0x3C/0x3D), an SSD1306
            test pattern to tell SSD1306 from SH1106, and raw 32-bit thermocouple
            frames decoded as both MAX31855 and MAX6675 once a second.
            Used to identify the hardware on the bench (#3). Turn it off again
            for normal development.

endmenu
